{"login": "dustin-decker", "location": "San Francisco", "commits": [{"sha": "994ff15373d1742e87fa2aeb43394676ef737edf", "message": "Added auto-generated ssl keys to .gitignore", "created_at": "2015-06-13T15:46:36Z", "repo": "WhatWhereWhen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a2739846e5224d37aa495e4ea728a94056751f86", "message": "Create LICENSE.md", "created_at": "2015-06-13T13:58:54Z", "repo": "WhatWhereWhen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fa219d8675a1c637158c430c7651c5494d33a820", "message": "Limited post size\n\nPrior to this the post size was limited to http server settings. Post\nlimiting within flask to prevent flooding of the database.\nAdded disclaimer to WIP install.md", "created_at": "2015-03-17T02:38:04Z", "repo": "WhatWhereWhen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9c5732b4015ec2e94957f2c1cc86745ea0a74a27", "message": "Module upgrade, formatting and testdata_toapi change\n\nUsing current requests module.\nCenter div on all pages + added missing html tags.\nTestdata_toapi setup for deployed server and uses  a random digit for\nlocation to provide a better demonstration. Time is recorded for pushing\ntest data.", "created_at": "2015-03-09T01:49:50Z", "repo": "WhatWhereWhen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "18098c3c646aaa64c92784fb4951fa4c4bc386c5", "message": "Route changes\n\nChanged form and redirect paths to be relative.", "created_at": "2015-03-08T19:38:44Z", "repo": "WhatWhereWhen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "18b01d7f1fde1ea6f810e10e3ae53fbc0d26fbdd", "message": "Added disclaimer to development feature\n\n/deleteall route is vulnerable to CSRF with its current implementation.\nThis is a development feature and would not be in a production\nenvironment.", "created_at": "2015-03-08T17:57:24Z", "repo": "WhatWhereWhen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6ed202ba2cee2adc8888b59c3bd8595ef700e8a8", "message": "Added random secret key generation\n\nAdded random secret key generation\n\nSecret key used for signing cookies\nand is a security issue if it is\npublished.", "created_at": "2015-03-05T01:50:57Z", "repo": "WhatWhereWhen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "dcd1fc3c9951488612eac96fc613f8d28471de94", "message": "Added request rate limiting\n\nAdded request rate limiting for upserting and find functions to prevent\nserver overload .", "created_at": "2014-08-16T15:09:13Z", "repo": "WhatWhereWhen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bb6ec2649c178ad8e87b4a1f173266021b8bc0a3", "message": "Fixed table overflow flaw\n\nBefore, if inserted entries were large, table formatting was destroyed.\nNow overflow is hidden and cell sizes are fixed percentages.", "created_at": "2014-08-16T13:39:24Z", "repo": "WhatWhereWhen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "14583b0c65919f7a66d71680676bc42ba9cc8569", "message": "Fixed errors, removed delete all entries link\n\nFixed Error 500 when reporting a non existent tag.\nRemoved JSON hijacking protection since it is not currently used and was\ngiving an error.\nRemoved delete all link on pages since it is a convenient development\nfeature and will not remain through production.", "created_at": "2014-08-16T13:08:40Z", "repo": "WhatWhereWhen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "708f2d5dbfcbbc69ed4424a4372359f48e7ab4e7", "message": "Security and test changes\n\nAdded clickjacking protection, force browser XSS filter, JSON hijacking.\nAdded production-ready server run line.\nMade server references in testdata_toapi.py as a variable so they are\neasier to change.", "created_at": "2014-08-16T12:53:45Z", "repo": "WhatWhereWhen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0839e8926d277cf4f0789aa0088b5ed068e1820c", "message": "Added scripts to insert test data\n\ntestdata_direct inserts directly to database\ntestdata_toapi submits via API (slowly)", "created_at": "2014-08-15T23:47:38Z", "repo": "WhatWhereWhen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d15f826e0196069478e177e0c2200fb1bc9ec49c", "message": "Added tables to the web ui, some fixes, and cleanup\n\nRemoved some old, unused auth lines.\nAdded some commenting and doc strings.\nAdded table presentation to web ui pages. XSS vulnerbility is prevented\nby escaping tag characters.\nChanged reportwrite function to upsert changes (update document) rather\nthan insert (replace document) after an ObjectID error cropped up.\nReplaced blank fields with blank string because fetching the fields did\nnot make any sense.\nPrettied up the static page html.\nImproved some variable and field names.\nChanged table query to last N documents added rather than dumping the\nwhole collection.\nAdded a basic CSS3 style to the pages.", "created_at": "2014-08-15T23:45:51Z", "repo": "WhatWhereWhen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b2e7f40134caa47ce8920e4d213f810a03415fba", "message": "Added dynamic menu\n\nA dynamically generated menu now appears on the web ui pages", "created_at": "2014-08-14T23:27:22Z", "repo": "WhatWhereWhen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "31f391711dd38e7b61dc49cccc08c5edb7c1904e", "message": "Added time stamps\n\nTime stamp is added to the DB when the location is recorded. Time stamps\nare retained through location history also.", "created_at": "2014-08-14T23:26:26Z", "repo": "WhatWhereWhen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bb8f73ab898a673bbe6b66aff585d658f4e1d1b5", "message": "Added location history\n\nLast 5 locations of assets are kept in the DB now. Need to add location\nhistory view.", "created_at": "2014-08-14T23:25:01Z", "repo": "WhatWhereWhen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "40172f1a46dcda1201dcdb4e48ec1d414cc79314", "message": "Added Basic Auth\n\nAuthentication required to make any DB changes now", "created_at": "2014-08-13T22:59:01Z", "repo": "WhatWhereWhen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5049fc9e857c7cfa98cc2e87216bdd423ab49338", "message": "Added CSRF protection\n\nCross-site request forgery protection", "created_at": "2014-08-13T22:57:56Z", "repo": "WhatWhereWhen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9ad00519d7577cde9751490c9cb8444f6b23300a", "message": "Added OpenSSL\n\nEncrypted API and web access", "created_at": "2014-08-13T22:56:39Z", "repo": "WhatWhereWhen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2705ef68934e230d6fcfca41407fe06c2842efcf", "message": "Initial commit\n\nBasic API and Web GUI", "created_at": "2014-08-13T22:53:06Z", "repo": "WhatWhereWhen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c20148d2eb2235c2d83e3465a26a7c881b6dd72b", "message": "Initial Commit\n\nProject according to the example on the website.", "created_at": "2015-03-16T20:42:08Z", "repo": "Programmatic-3D-Model-Generation", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bf1059ab59a40a64cc022035181d055000934876", "message": ":lollipop: Added .gitattributes", "created_at": "2015-03-16T20:41:26Z", "repo": "Programmatic-3D-Model-Generation", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "31c44b568d3ca4d52454355b5364a9f97b69b076", "message": "Minor changes for deployment", "created_at": "2015-09-20T23:17:23Z", "repo": "ShadowParser", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f8b997844c46f5e261045023fd13a6a80cc30